opt.input.device.label=Device
opt.input.device.desc=Auto takes a controller when one is there, else the keyboard and mouse.
opt.input.api.label=Controller API
opt.input.api.desc=Auto reads a controller through XInput when it has it (Xbox, most PC pads), else through SDL3 (DualShock 4, DualSense, Switch and others). With DS4Windows, XInput, or one controller counts twice.
opt.input.deadzone.label=Stick dead zone
opt.input.deadzone.desc=How far a stick moves before it counts.
opt.input.enter_button.label=Confirm button
opt.input.enter_button.desc=The button that confirms in the menus.
opt.input.vibration.label=Vibration
opt.input.vibration.desc=Controller rumble.
opt.cheats.damage_taken.label=Damage to Kratos
opt.cheats.damage_taken.desc=How much of a hit he takes. None: hits take no health from him.
opt.cheats.damage_dealt.label=Kratos's damage
opt.cheats.damage_dealt.desc=How much his hits take from an enemy. One hit: all of its health.
opt.cheats.max_orbs.label=Max red orbs
opt.cheats.max_orbs.desc=The red orbs are held at the most the game allows, 1,000,000. A save made with this on keeps them.
opt.cheats.infinite_magic.label=Infinite magic and items
opt.cheats.infinite_magic.desc=The magic and item meters stay full.
opt.cheats.infinite_rage.label=Infinite rage
opt.cheats.infinite_rage.desc=The rage meter stays full.
opt.cheats.infinite_jumps.label=Infinite double jumps
opt.cheats.infinite_jumps.desc=Kratos can jump again in the air, as often as he likes.
