opt.patches.disable_mlaa.label=Disable MLAA
opt.patches.disable_mlaa.desc=The PS3's SPU anti-aliasing; this port never shows its output, so it only costs time. About 5% faster. Bloom goes with it; FSR 3.1 and frame generation need it off.
opt.patches.disable_depth_of_field.label=Disable Depth of Field
opt.patches.disable_depth_of_field.desc=Removes the blur outside the camera's focus.
opt.patches.disable_motion_blur.label=Disable Motion Blur
opt.patches.disable_motion_blur.desc=Saves the blur work when something moves. With MLAA off it never reaches the screen; FSR 3.1 and frame generation keep their own motion vectors.
opt.patches.disable_mesh_trimming.label=Disable Mesh Trimming
opt.patches.disable_mesh_trimming.desc=Keeps the triangles the game discards for its 720p mesh. For internal resolution above 720p it only adds geometry: 3% slower in the first level, 11% at the gate.
opt.patches.disable_shadows.label=Disable Shadows
opt.patches.disable_shadows.desc=No dynamic shadows: the biggest gain, about 25% faster in the fight.
